  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint (+2), moderate (+4), or strong (+6) Enhancement; <strong>CL</strong> 4th (+2), 8th (+4), or 12th (+6)<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> headband; <strong>Price</strong> 4,000 (+2), 16,000 (+4), 36,000 (+6); <strong>Weight</strong> 2 lbs.</p>\n<p>This cloth headband feels faintly stimulating while worn, though most scholars are pretty sure it has not actually been infused with drugs. While worn, it grants a +2/+4/+6 enhancement bonus to Intelligence. Treat this as a temporary ability bonus for the first 24 hours the headband is worn. These headbands grant bonus ranks in 1 (+2), 2 (+4), or 3 (+6) skills equal to the wearer’s character level, chosen when the item is created.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nForge Charm, Enhancement sphere (Mental Enhancement (enhance)); <strong>Cost</strong> 2,000 gp (+2), 8,000 gp (+4), or 18,000 gp (+6)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/charms#toc26\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Reviewed selection: base +2 Intelligence, 4000 gp; one crafted skill not selected.</p><p>One two-pound cloth headband grants +2 enhancement to Intelligence. Its one associated skill must be chosen when crafted; the source grants ranks equal to character level. Do not substitute a random Knowledge skill, Hit Dice from another item, additive ranks or a broad skill bonus. Assign/track that selected skill deliberately. Reused artwork grants no psionics. The native enhancement changes the current ability total while equipped, matching the inspected PF1 item. Treat it as temporary for the first twenty-four worn hours; timing, eligibility and any permanent-only consequences remain manual. No automatic clock, higher tier, extra skill ranks or permanent base-score edit.</p><p>Purchase price corrected from the draft construction-cost value to the published four-thousand-gp base tier; issue #37. Full source text and snapshot hashes are unchanged.</p>",
      "unidentified": ""
    },
